{"id":"5c893deb0a1811da","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-sl2z.md","title":"SL2Z","display":"df-sl2z — SL2Z","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sl2z","aliases":["58-df-sl2z"],"display":"df-sl2z — SL2Z","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sl2z"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sl2z</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sl2z — SL2Z"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\in V\">\\(SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\in V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sl2z} \\vdash SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\{0,1\\}\\times\\{0,1\\}}:A(0,0)A(1,1)-A(0,1)A(1,0)=1\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sl2z} \\vdash SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\{0,1\\}\\times\\{0,1\\}}:A(0,0)A(1,1)-A(0,1)A(1,0)=1\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The effective action on the upper half-plane has kernel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\pm I\\}\">\\(\\{\\pm I\\}\\)</span>; the classical modular group in this action is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)=SL_2(\\mathbb Z)/\\{\\pm I\\}\">\\(PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)=SL_2(\\mathbb Z)/\\{\\pm I\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sl2z} \\vdash SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\{0,1\\}\\times\\{0,1\\}}:A(0,0)A(1,1)-A(0,1)A(1,0)=1\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\{\\pm I\\}","display":false},{"tex":"PSL_2(\\mathbb Z)=SL_2(\\mathbb Z)/\\{\\pm I\\}","display":false}],"bytes":547,"backlinks":[{"id":"dbeb6e7ed5730d0f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-sl2z.md|58-df-sl2z]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":[]}